Package: crypto-trading-lab
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ${python3:Depends}, python3-sqlalchemy, python3-pyqt6
Description: Educational platform for cryptocurrency markets
 Crypto Trading Lab is an educational, research, and simulation platform
 for cryptocurrency markets. It implements chapters from Advances in
 Financial Machine Learning (López de Prado, 2018) and provides
 paper-trading and real-trading indicators, backtesting lab, learning
 center, and performance metrics.
 .
 This tool is designed for educational purposes and research. It never
 promises profits and must tell the user the truth when no statistical
 edge exists. Capital protection outranks profit seeking.
